flowchart LR
  operator[Operator browser]
  git[Allowed Git remote]
  docker[One Docker daemon]
  compose[Compose workloads]
  snapshot[Stopped recovery snapshot]

  subgraph paired[Implemented paired Compose deployment]
    web[dockercd-web\nGo server-rendered UI\nread-only filesystem; no Docker socket]
    control[dockercd control node\nGo daemon: API, reconciler, health/event workers]
    state[(SQLite state + Git cache\ncontroller volume)]
  end

  operator -->|loopback HTTP in checked-in Compose;\nHTTPS needs external reverse proxy| web
  web -->|GET /api/v1/presentation/*\nscoped bearer stays server-side| control
  control -->|SQLite WAL| state
  control -->|allowlisted Git sync| git
  control -->|inspect/events; docker compose deploy| docker
  docker --> compose
  snapshot -.->|offline immutable SQLite read;\nno Docker or Web connection| verifier[recovery-drill-verify\nexact recovery-event cardinality]

  classDef privileged fill:#ffe6e6,stroke:#b42318,color:#3b0a06;
  classDef unprivileged fill:#e6f4ff,stroke:#175cd3,color:#062a5e;
  classDef evidence fill:#f4f3ff,stroke:#6941c6,color:#2d1b69;
  class control,state privileged;
  class web unprivileged;
  class verifier,snapshot evidence;
